You tell 'em, Mr. Krabs.
- 呼！
你告诉他们，蟹老板。

01:17.067 --> 01:20.167
Bring it around town!
Yeah!
带它到城里转转！
是的！

01:21.700 --> 01:23.200
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:23.200 --> 01:25.567
[blubbers]
Bring it around somewhere!
[哭声]
把它带到某个地方！

01:25.567 --> 01:27.733
- [grunts]
Open the doors
- [咕哝]
打开门

01:27.733 --> 01:30.533
and let the consuming
commence!
并让消费
开始！

01:30.533 --> 01:33.133
I'll be in me office
