01:35.367 --> 01:36.567
- [imitating Mr. Krabs]
"I'll be in me office
- [模仿蟹老板]
“我会在我的办公室

01:36.567 --> 01:38.167
polishing
yesterday's booty."
抛光
昨天的战利品。”

01:38.167 --> 01:40.067
[grunting]
- [gasps]
[咕噜声]
- [喘气]

01:40.067 --> 01:41.367
