Mr. Krabs.
- 这不是侮辱
蟹老板。

01:46.333 --> 01:49.533
It was a--a--a--a tribute.
这是一种致敬。

01:49.533 --> 01:51.300
Haven't you ever heard
of "imitation is
你没听说过吗
的“模仿”是

01:51.300 --> 01:54.433
the sincerest form
of flattery"?
最真诚的形式
奉承”？

01:54.433 --> 01:57.067
