蟹老板真是受宠若惊
通过你的模仿。

02:21.967 --> 02:23.900
- Already forgot about it.
- 已经忘记了。

02:25.567 --> 02:29.933
Imitation plus flattery
equals happy people.
模仿加奉承
等于幸福的人。

02:29.933 --> 02:33.133
[hums]
[哼哼]

02:33.133 --> 02:35.833
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:35.833 --> 02:39.433
- Whoa, okay.
Everybody, come on now.
- 哇，好吧。
大家快来吧。

02:39.433 --> 02:42.500
Settle down,
