Whoa, okay now.
- [模仿爸爸]
哇，现在好了。

02:44.067 --> 02:46.867
Everybody, settle down.
Time to eat your patties.
大家都安定下来吧。
是时候吃你的肉饼了。

02:46.867 --> 02:47.900
Huh?
啊？

02:47.900 --> 02:49.633
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:49.633 --> 02:51.767
- Wow, that's just like me.
- 哇，这就像我一样。

02:51.767 --> 02:52.767
[laughs]
[笑]

02:52.767 --> 02:54.900
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:54.900 --> 02:56.833
I said eat your patties!
我说吃你的肉饼吧！

02:58.433 --> 02:59.800
Hurry up, SpongeBob,
海绵宝宝，快点

02:59.800 --> 03:02.833
I need two double orders
of Krabby Krust stat.
我需要两份双重订单
Krabby Krust 统计数据。

03:02.833 --> 03:04.500
- No problem, Squidward,
I'll get you those orders
- 没问题，章鱼哥，
我会给你那些订单

03:04.500 --> 03:06.067
as soon as possible.
尽快地。

03:06.067 --> 03:08.167
[imitating Squidward] Or never,
whichever comes first.
[模仿章鱼哥] 或者永远不会，
以先到者为准。

03:08.167 --> 03:10.800
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:10.800 --> 03:12.333
Oh, swoon.
哦，晕倒了。

03:12.333 --> 03:14.733
That imitation stuff
really works.
那些仿制品
真的有效。

03:14.733 --> 03:15.900
Look out, world!
小心，世界！

03:15.900 --> 03:18.500
I'm gonna flatter
your socks off.
我要拍马屁
你脱掉袜子吧。

03:19.733 --> 03:21.400
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:21.400 --> 03:23.267
Hmm. Nope.
唔。没有。

03:23.267 --> 03:24.633
Ah.
啊。

03:28.067 --> 03:29.600
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

03:29.600 --> 03:32.233
[imitating Patrick] Hey, there,
Patrick old buddy.
[模仿帕特里克]嘿，那里，
帕特里克老朋友。

03:32.233 --> 03:33.400
