That's the worst
SpongeBob impression
这是最糟糕的
海绵宝宝印象

03:52.067 --> 03:53.167
I've ever seen.
我曾经见过。

03:53.167 --> 03:55.167
- [laughs]
- [笑]

03:55.167 --> 03:56.833
Wait, what?
等等，什么？

03:59.833 --> 04:01.200
