- [咕哝]

04:01.200 --> 04:03.833
Rook to king four.
车到王四。

04:03.833 --> 04:05.500
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:07.300 --> 04:09.067
Check-mate.
将死。

04:10.433 --> 04:12.467
- Plankton, maybe
we should play a game
- 浮游生物，也许
我们应该玩个游戏

04:12.467 --> 04:14.100
that's a little less dangerous.
这样危险性要小一些。

04:14.100 --> 04:16.367
You're flatter
than hammered horse hockey.
你比较扁平
比锤击马曲棍球。

04:16.367 --> 04:17.733
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:19.167 --> 04:21.067
