04:24.800 --> 04:25.933
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

04:27.133 --> 04:28.533
[imitating Plankton]
And you are the fuzziest
[模仿浮游生物]
而你是最模糊的

04:28.533 --> 04:31.067
nut-eating scientist
