- [笑]

04:39.467 --> 04:42.600
That is me to a Texas "T,"
SpongeBob.
这就是我对德克萨斯州“T”的看法
海绵宝宝。

04:42.600 --> 04:44.400
He nailed you too,
Plankton.
他也钉了你，
浮游生物。

04:44.400 --> 04:45.967
- It was okay.
- 没关系。

04:45.967 --> 04:49.400
He got my face right,
