[叹气]

05:26.333 --> 05:29.533
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:30.733 --> 05:32.200
[imitating Squidward]
Are we having fun yet,
【模仿章鱼哥】
我们还玩得开心吗

05:32.200 --> 05:33.433
Squidward Tentacles?
章鱼哥的触手？

05:33.433 --> 05:35.067
