really getting out of control
- 男孩，海绵宝宝是
真的失控了

05:49.367 --> 05:50.933
with his impression
obsession.
以他的印象
痴迷。

05:52.200 --> 05:53.200
Ah!
啊!

05:53.200 --> 05:54.767
- Right you are,
Sandy.
- 你是对的，
桑迪。

05:54.767 --> 05:57.167
SpongeBob has lost touch
with reality.
海绵宝宝失去联系
与现实。

05:57.167 --> 05:58.567
I've seen it before.
我以前见过。

05:58.567 --> 06:01.267
They call it:
the "mocking mimicry madness."
他们称之为：
“嘲笑模仿的疯狂”。

06:01.267 --> 06:04.467
- [imitating Mr. Krabs]
The mocking mimicry madness.
- [模仿蟹老板]
嘲笑模仿的疯狂。

06:04.467 --> 06:06.200
- [screams]
- [laughs]
- [尖叫]
- [笑]

06:06.200 --> 06:07.867
- Oh, oh, oh!
[grunts]
- 哦，哦，哦！
[咕哝]

06:07.867 --> 06:09.133
- Huh! Oh.
- 哈！哦。

06:09.133 --> 06:10.467
- [laughs]
- [笑]

06:11.867 --> 06:14.667
- All right, remember guys,
this is an intervention,
- 好吧，记住伙计们，
这是一种干预，

06:14.667 --> 06:16.933
so we need to make sure
that above all,
所以我们需要确保
最重要的是，

06:16.933 --> 06:20.167
SpongeBob knows how much
we all care about him.
海绵宝宝知道多少
我们都关心他。

06:20.167 --> 06:23.067
- Why don't we just destroy him
and get it over with?
- 我们为什么不干脆毁了他
并结束它？

06:23.067 --> 06:24.200
- Here here.
- 这里这里。

06:24.200 --> 06:26.800
- You leave
my best friend alone!
- 你离开
我最好的朋友一个人！

06:26.800 --> 06:28.533
both: It was just
a suggestion.
两人：这只是
一个建议。

06:28.533 --> 06:30.133
- Spread out!
- 散开！

06:30.133 --> 06:35.433
All right, you scurvy dogs,
SpongeBob needs us,
好吧，你们这些坏血狗，
海绵宝宝需要我们

06:35.433 --> 06:39.100
and more importantly,
I need him--
更重要的是，
我需要他——

06:39.100 --> 06:41.967
to stop imitating
me customers!
停止模仿
我的顾客们！

06:41.967 --> 06:45.767
- Right guys, that's...
almost...the spirit.
- 对了，伙计们，那是……
几乎……精神。

06:45.767 --> 06:47.067
[doorbell ringing]
[门铃响]

06:47.067 --> 06:48.467
- Oh, boy,
someone's at the door.
- 哦，男孩，
有人在门口。

06:48.467 --> 06:50.300
I can't wait
to imitate 'em.
