- * 我...不... *

09:17.300 --> 09:22.233
* Kno-o-ow
* 知识

09:25.233 --> 09:28.167
- The salty tear trail leads
right in here.
- 咸咸的泪痕引向
就在这里。

09:28.167 --> 09:29.500
- There he is!
- 他在那儿！

09:29.500 --> 09:31.067
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

09:31.067 --> 09:33.500
- Are you all right,
SpongeBob?
- 你还好吗，
海绵宝宝？

09:33.500 --> 09:35.433
How many fingers
am I holding up?
有多少根手指
我坚持住了吗？

09:36.600 --> 09:38.933
- [groans]
B.
- [呻吟]
B.

09:38.933 --> 09:41.100
- Good, SpongeBob,
I had the same answer.
- 好，海绵宝宝，
我也有同样的答案。

09:41.100 --> 09:44.567
- I know you're in there
somewhere, SquarePants.
- 我知道你在里面
某处，方裤。

09:44.567 --> 09:47.500
- We're sorry,
the person you are calling--
- 我们很抱歉，
你正在打电话的人——

09:47.500 --> 09:49.100
SpongeBob SquarePants--
海绵宝宝--

09:49.100 --> 09:51.967
has been disconnected
or is no longer in service.
已断开连接
或不再使用。

09:51.967 --> 09:55.233
- Okay, guys, SpongeBob imitates
whoever he hears,
- 好吧，伙计们，海绵宝宝正在模仿
无论他听到谁的声音，

09:55.233 --> 09:59.067
so we've all got to imitate him
to help him remember who he is.
所以我们都得模仿他
帮助他记住他是谁。

09:59.067 --> 10:00.500
This should help.
[grunts]
这应该有帮助。
[咕哝]

10:00.500 --> 10:02.300
- Hey!
- [grunts]
- 嘿！
- [咕哝]

10:02.300 --> 10:03.400
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

10:03.400 --> 10:05.467
Mmm! Mmm!
嗯！嗯！

10:05.467 --> 10:07.400
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:08.700 --> 10:09.967
Ah! Hold still,
you little rascal!
啊!保持不动，
你这个小流氓！

10:09.967 --> 10:11.433
- No!
[groans]
- 不！
[呻吟]

10:13.367 --> 10:15.733
What a great idea.
多好的主意啊。

10:15.733 --> 10:17.067
Ugh!
啊!

10:18.533 --> 10:20.667
- [imitating SpongeBob]
I'm a square and yellow critter!
- [模仿海绵宝宝]
我是一只黄色的方形小动物！

10:20.667 --> 10:22.333
[laughs]
[笑]

10:22.333 --> 10:25.233
- [imitating SpongeBob]
I like cooking with lard!
- [模仿海绵宝宝]
我喜欢用猪油做饭！

10:25.233 --> 10:28.000
[laughs]
[笑]

10:29.367 --> 10:31.067
- [imitating SpongeBob]
Mr. Krabs is the best boss
- [模仿海绵宝宝]
蟹老板是最好的老板

10:31.067 --> 10:33.867
in the whole ocean.
[snickers]
在整个海洋中。
[窃笑]

10:33.867 --> 10:36.000
Oop! Sorry.
I mean--
哎呀！对不起。
我是说 -

10:36.000 --> 10:39.033
[laughs like SpongeBob]
Uh--
[像海绵宝宝一样笑]
呃——

10:39.033 --> 10:41.600
- [imitating SpongeBob] I forgot
the secret Krabby Patty formula,
- [模仿海绵宝宝]我忘了
秘制蟹黄派配方，

10:41.600 --> 10:44.100
Mr. K.
Would you remind me again?
K 先生
你能再提醒我一下吗？

10:44.100 --> 10:47.567
- Sure, SpongeBob,
I got it right--
- 当然，海绵宝宝，
我猜对了——

10:47.567 --> 10:50.433
Oh, no, you don't,
Plankton.
哦，不，你不，
浮游生物。

10:52.267 --> 10:54.667
That was a pretty good
impression, though.
那是一个相当不错的
不过，印象。

10:56.167 --> 10:57.367
- Thanks.
- 谢谢。

10:57.367 --> 10:59.300
- [babbling]
- [胡言乱语]

10:59.300 --> 11:00.567
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

11:00.567 --> 11:02.133
It's not working,
fellers!
这不起作用，
伙计们！

11:02.133 --> 11:04.133
We need to combine our efforts
and do an impression
我们需要共同努力
并留下印象

11:04.133 --> 11:06.400
of SpongeBob
all at the same time.
海绵宝宝的
全部同时进行。

11:06.400 --> 11:08.133
Okay, all together now.
好吧，现在大家在一起了。

11:08.133 --> 11:11.400
all: [imitating SpongeBob]
I'm ready. I'm ready. I'm ready.
全部：[模仿海绵宝宝]
我准备好了。我准备好了。我准备好了。

11:11.400 --> 11:16.800
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:18.167 --> 11:20.600
- I'm ready. I'm ready.
- 我准备好了。我准备好了。

11:20.600 --> 11:22.533
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

11:22.533 --> 11:25.067
I remember.
I know who I am.
我记得。
我知道我是谁。

11:25.067 --> 11:27.167
I am SpongeBob SquarePants,
我是海绵宝宝

11:27.167 --> 11:30.633
and yes, I do like
cooking with lard.
是的，我确实喜欢
用猪油做饭。

11:30.633 --> 11:32.167
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

11:32.167 --> 11:33.933
Thanks, guys,
you're the best friends
谢谢你们，
你们是最好的朋友

11:33.933 --> 11:35.567
a guy with memory loss
could have.
一个失忆的人
可以有。

11:35.567 --> 11:37.767
It sure feels great
to just be yourself.
确实感觉很棒
做你自己。

11:37.767 --> 11:40.100
Doesn't it, guys?
Guys?
不是吗，伙计们？
伙计们？

11:41.333 --> 11:43.067
[all laughing like SpongeBob]
Oh, no!
[大家都笑得像海绵宝宝一样]
哦，不！

11:43.067 --> 11:45.833
Now they have
mocking mimicry madness.
现在他们有
嘲笑模仿的疯狂。

11:45.833 --> 11:48.633
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:48.633 --> 11:49.967
- Let me out!
Let me out!
- 让我出去！
放我出去吧！

- 让我出去！
放我出去吧！